such as the environment and global peace.

49
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:11,430
We can make some predictions.

50
00:05:12,470 --> 00:05:17,070
Grammatically, we need an adjective to describe the noun concerns.

51
00:05:18,410 --> 00:05:24,730
Meaning-wise, since the examples are environment and peace, the missing word

52
00:05:24,730 --> 00:05:28,490
likely relates to social or global issues.

53
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:36,140
Step 5. Apply scanning skills to
