102
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:42,890
Of course, to fully absorb the knowledge, you need
to do the exercises attached below and practice more.

103
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:48,930
These are some important notes I've summarized
for you from the two videos on summary completion.

104
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:53,530
The questions might not come in order as the information in the passage.

105
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:58,390
It is not necessary to read and understand the whole passage.

106
00:10:58,950 --> 00:11:02,890
Instead, focus on sentences in the summary and the keywords.

107
00:11:04,010 --> 00:11:09,530
Make predictions for the answers based on word form, grammar, meaning, and the

108
00:11:09,530 --> 00:11:14,330
word list, if any, to locate information
areas containing the answers carefully.

109
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:19,790
For summary with the word list, the words or phrases to be filled in must

110
00:11:19,790 --> 00:11:26,210
be taken directly from the passage, be synonyms
or antonyms for the words in the passage.

111
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:31,730
For summary with the word list, the answers you write in the answer sheet when

112
00:11:31,730 --> 00:11:35,810
taking paper-based tests, or in the blanks when taking computer-based tests,

113
00:11:36,310 --> 00:11:39,930
are letters A, B, C, etc. in the word list.

